fin-market-data:PriceObservationShape a sh:NodeShape;
    sh:description "Source-record-scoped observation of one non-FX instrument price. It names an exact stream, instrument, listing-or-OTC context, and direct-unit quotation contract; Money carries the sole currency truth. VWAP and TWAP observations additionally bind an exact calculation definition and an immutable calculation run whose byte-locked input FactVersion set, selection window, input-set digest, output, and recalculation policy are replayable.";
