fin-orders:ExecutionShape a sh:NodeShape;
    sh:description "Immutable provider trade or fill fact in one exact event stream with one external order and originating intent, explicit execution-side Party/account and contra-side Party/account roles, instrument, positive absolute quantity, independent side, Money price, listed-or-OTC context, and the exact matching DirectUnitPriceQuotationContract. An optional executing broker is an intermediary role and never substitutes for either bilateral Party/account role.";
